NAME
       test_shell

SYNOPSIS
       test_shell [OPTION]… [ARG]…

ARGUMENTS
       ARG Use me to test for completion restart of other tools after the --
           token. This may not work through a b0 invocation. Install
           completion for the test_shell tool and invoke the tool directly
           from the path output with b0 --path -- test_shell.

OPTIONS
       -c ENUM, --choice=ENUM (absent=one)
           Use me to test for enum completion for short and long options.

       -d DIR, --dir=DIR
           Use me to test for dirpath completion.

       -f FILE, --file=FILE
           Use me to test for filepath completion.

       --message=VAL
           Use me to test the Message directive in completion

       -p PATH, --path=PATH
           Use me to test for path completion.

COMMON OPTIONS
       --help[=FMT] (default=auto)
           Show this help in format FMT. The value FMT must be one of auto,
           pager, groff or plain. With auto, the format is pager or plain
           whenever the TERM env var is dumb or undefined.

       --version
           Show version information.

EXIT STATUS
       test_shell exits with:

       0   on success.

       123 on indiscriminate errors reported on standard error.

       124 on command line parsing errors.

       125 on unexpected internal errors (bugs).

